+// 原版专服在档案完成回调里把玩家的枪械配件与角色外观写入 PlayerState 的逐角色档案；本机专服没有那次回调。
+// 在原生确认干员之前，对已核验的本机房主补上这名干员当前主副枪的保存配置，随后由原生出生流程自己建枪和复制。
+void BrtArchiveBeforeConfirm(SDK::UObject* controller, void* params) noexcept {
+    try {
+        const auto session = watched;
+        if (!session || !controller || !params || controller != session->identity ||
+            UKismetSystemLibrary::Conv_SoftObjectReferenceToObject(session->owner) != controller ||
+            !controller->IsA(APBPlayerController::StaticClass())) return;
+        auto& pc = *static_cast<APBPlayerController*>(controller);
+        auto* state = pc.PBPlayerState;
+        if (!pc.HasAuthority() || !state || state != session->loginState || pc.PlayerState != state ||
+            !pc.NetConnection || pc.NetConnection != session->loginTransport ||
+            state->GetDefaultIDStr().ToString() != session->member.steam) { ArchiveLog("event=skipped reason=owner-changed"); return; }
+        const auto image = reinterpret_cast<std::uintptr_t>(GetModuleHandleW(nullptr));
+        static const bool supported = brt::preorder::native::SupportedImage(image, ReadGame);
+        if (!supported) { ArchiveLog("event=skipped reason=unsupported-game-image"); return; }
+        const FName role = static_cast<Params::PBPlayerController_ServerConfirmRoleSelection*>(params)->InRoleID;
+        const auto row = std::find_if(session->rows.begin(), session->rows.end(),
+            [&](const auto& candidate) { return Intern(candidate.id) == role; });
+        if (row == session->rows.end()) { ArchiveLog("event=skipped reason=role-outside-owner-menu"); return; }
+        auto* value = brt::native_archive::RoleValue(image, state, RawOf(role));
+        if (!value) { ArchiveLog("event=skipped role=%s reason=native-role-entry-missing", row->id.c_str()); return; }
+        const int before = brt::native_archive::WeaponCount(value);
+        // 档案条目与两张预订表通常一致；不一致时各自的主副枪都补上，由原生按最终选择取用。
+        std::vector<GunPair> wanted{{brt::native_archive::NameAt(value, brt::native_archive::FirstWeapon),
+                                     brt::native_archive::NameAt(value, brt::native_archive::SecondWeapon)}};
+        for (const std::uintptr_t offset : {std::uintptr_t{0x6C0}, std::uintptr_t{0x6E0}})
+            if (const auto guns = TableGuns(state, RawOf(role), offset);
+                guns && std::find(wanted.begin(), wanted.end(), *guns) == wanted.end()) wanted.push_back(*guns);
+        ArchiveLog("event=confirm role=%s weapons-before=%d selections=%d", row->id.c_str(), before, static_cast<int>(wanted.size()));
+        int guns = 0, look = -1;
+        for (const auto& pair : wanted) {
+            // 与本人保存的枪同名时沿用档案服务的写法，其余取引擎名称。
+            const auto gun = [&](std::uint64_t raw) {
+                for (unsigned slot = 0; slot < 2; ++slot)
+                    if (row->items[slot] != None && RawOf(Intern(row->items[slot])) == raw) return Name(row->items[slot]);
+                return Name(NameOf(raw).ToString());
+            };
+            const Selection chosen{row->id, gun(pair.first), gun(pair.second)};
+            std::string reply;
+            try { reply = session->room.OwnerBirthPlan(session->member, 1000000 + ++session->archiveRequests, chosen); }
+            catch (const std::exception&) {
+                ArchiveLog("event=plan-unavailable role=%s first=%s second=%s", row->id.c_str(), chosen.primary.c_str(), chosen.secondary.c_str());
+                continue;
+            }
+            const auto plan = ReadPlan(reply, chosen);
+            if (!plan) { ArchiveLog("event=plan-invalid role=%s first=%s second=%s", row->id.c_str(), chosen.primary.c_str(), chosen.secondary.c_str()); continue; }
+            for (const Weapon* weapon : {&plan->primary, &plan->secondary}) {
+                if (!brt::native_archive::ApplyWeapon(image, value, *weapon, Intern)) continue;
+                ++guns;
+                int fitted = 0;
+                for (const auto& part : weapon->parts) fitted += part.id != None;
+                ArchiveLog("event=weapon role=%s gun=%s fitted-slots=%d skin=%s paint=%s ornament=%s", row->id.c_str(), weapon->id.c_str(),
+                    fitted, weapon->appearance.skin.c_str(), weapon->appearance.paint.c_str(), weapon->ornament.c_str());
+            }
+            if (look < 0 && plan->character) {
+                look = brt::native_archive::ApplyCharacter(value, *plan->character, Intern);
+                ArchiveLog("event=character role=%s fields=%d suit=%s paint=%s", row->id.c_str(), look,
+                    plan->character->suit.value_or(None).c_str(), plan->character->painting.value_or(None).c_str());
+            }
+        }
+        ArchiveLog("event=written role=%s guns=%d weapons-after=%d", row->id.c_str(), guns, brt::native_archive::WeaponCount(value));
+    } catch (const std::exception&) { ArchiveLog("event=skipped reason=local-error"); }
+}
